---
description: Bounded sub-agent delegation, role selection, and integration when work is divisible or needs independent review
alwaysApply: false
---

When delegation is useful, follow `/instructions/SUBAGENTS.md`. Default to a bounded task packet: objective, non-goals, exact paths, relevant context, ownership, output format, checks, and stop conditions. Do not require shared startup/state/history reads or persistent role artifacts for ordinary delegates. Load `/instructions/ROLES.md` only for a formal role pipeline or consequential gates; then preserve its required/skipped-role records and evidence-backed handoffs. The lead inspects and verifies all results before integration.
